{
  "id": 808,
  "description": "# **Welcome to The**\n# **❌️Hunger Strikers❌️**\n   \n•We are active between 1300 UTC - 0400 UTC.\n\n•Daily raids are at:\n\n    Round ❶: 20:00 UTC\n\n    Round ❷: 21:00 UTC\n\n    Round ❸: 22:00 UTC\n\nEach weekday\n\n•Weekend assaults are at:\n\n    🏹Hunt: Fridays, or ASAP\n\n    🗡Fight: 17:00 UTC\n\n-We are able to adjust times if necessary.-\n\n•Raid locations vary depending on leveling needs.\n\n•If you have any questions, please dont hesitate to ask! There are no stupid questions. We are here to help!\n\n•We mainly chat in Discord. It is **highly encouraged** to join, otherwise you are missing out on A LOT and could potentionally miss very important announcements.\n\n☆Join raids for combat experience☆\n\n☆Join conquests to help us reach higher ranks☆\n\n**Join us on Discord for Raid/Assault Alerts, Contests, Guides and more!:**\nhttps://discord.gg/WSK3ABgMcU\n\n\n## **RULES:**\n\nWe are a fairly relaxed Guild, however, if you are found to be repeatedly breaking the rules, you may be kicked.\n\n   1. **Be Active**. Those who are not active within the Guild for 7 or more days without prior notice will be kicked.\n   2. **Communicate**. Join our Discord. Not doing so will result in a lot of missed information and lack of communication from other members. Otherwise, please DM me with any questions, requests of concerns!\n   3. **Contribute to the Guild** via the stockpile, joining assaults/raids and completing challenges. Those who do not contribute at all will be kicked.\n   4. **Be Kind**. Any racism, homophobia, transhobia or bigotry of any kind will NOT be tolerated. Bullying of any kind will NOT be tolerated.",
